{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2023-03-29 09:00:00', 'title': 'IBM CLOUD AND WASABI PARTNER TO POWER DATA INSIGHTS ACROSS HYBRID CLOUD ENVIRONMENTS', 'text': 'BOSTON RED SOX TO BE FIRST TO LEVERAGE IBM CLOUD SATELLITE®\xa0WITH WASABI HOT CLOUD STORAGE FOR GREATER DATA INSIGHT AND ACCESSIBILITY\xa0 ARMONK, N.Y. AND BOSTON , MARCH 29, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IBM (NYSE: IBM) AND WASABI TECHNOLOGIES , THE HOT CLOUD STORAGE COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THEY ARE COLLABORATING TO DRIVE DATA INNOVATION ACROSS HYBRID CLOUD ENVIRONMENTS.'}